{"id":"nce1-095","book":"nce1","numbers":[95,96],"label":"Lesson 95–96","titleEn":"Tickets, Please.","titleCn":"请把车票拿出来","audio":"media/lessons/nce1/095.mp3","lines":[{"t":3.52,"en":"Tickets, please.","cn":"请给我票。"},{"t":6.52,"en":"Listen to the tape then answer this question.","cn":"先听这段录音，然后再回答这个问题。"},{"t":12.47,"en":"Why did George and Ken miss the train?","cn":"为什么乔治和肯错过了火车？"},{"t":19.39,"en":"Two return tickets to London, please.","cn":"请给我两张去伦敦的往返机票。"},{"t":23.44,"en":"What time will the next train leave?","cn":"下一班火车什么时候出发？"},{"t":27.22,"en":"At nineteen minutes past eight.","cn":"八点十九分。"},{"t":31.52,"en":"Which platform?","cn":"哪个平台？"},{"t":33.4,"en":"Platform Two.","cn":"平台二。"},{"t":35.18,"en":"Over the bridge.","cn":"（用于鼓励某人克服困难或完成某件事）再坚持一下，就成功了。"},{"t":38.23,"en":"What time will the next train leave?","cn":"下一班火车什么时候出发？"},{"t":42.16,"en":"At eight nineteen.","cn":"在八点十九分。"},{"t":44.95,"en":"We've got plenty of time.","cn":"我们还有 plenty of time（大量的时间）。"},{"t":48.56,"en":"It's only three minutes to eight.","cn":"距离八点还只有三分钟。"},{"t":52.53,"en":"Let's go and have a drink.","cn":"我们一起去喝一杯吧。"},{"t":55.53,"en":"There's a bar next door to the station.","cn":"车站旁边有一家酒吧。"},{"t":60.69,"en":"We had better go back to the station now, Ken.","cn":"我们最好现在就回车站去，肯。"},{"t":65.8,"en":"Tickets, please.","cn":"请给我票。"},{"t":68.23,"en":"We want to catch the eight nineteen to London.","cn":"我们想搭乘89次航班去伦敦。"},{"t":72.91,"en":"You've just missed it!","cn":"你刚刚错过了它！"},{"t":75.7,"en":"What!","cn":"什么！"},{"t":77.02,"en":"It's only eight fifteen.","cn":"现在才八点十五分。"},{"t":80.19,"en":"I'm sorry, sir.","cn":"对不起，先生。"},{"t":82.24,"en":"That clock's ten minutes slow.","cn":"那个钟慢了十分钟。"},{"t":86.16,"en":"When's the next train?","cn":"下一班火车什么时候到？"},{"t":88.77,"en":"In five hours' time!","cn":"五小时后！"}],"words":[{"word":"return","phonetic":["ri'tə:n"],"pos":"n.","meaning":"往返","us":"media/words/nce1/w0643_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0643_e.mp3"},{"word":"train","phonetic":["trein"],"pos":"n.","mea